# rpg_space_planet_map.phases.pdl - asteroids and another ship ON THE PLANET MAP, the same space as the ship and Cata Prime (owner 2026-10-26: "i expected to see them on same map as planet/ship cata prime"). BOOK 16.game/RPG-SPACE-COLLISION-AND-DESTRUCTION-DESIGN.md 7i.
# Runner: ops/+x/playthrough_op.+x run play/phases/rpg_space_planet_map.phases.pdl (a scratch house under /tmp; nothing live is touched).
# Geometry the expected values come from: the hull covers desk cells 2..13 of the 16 x 16 desk; a desk cell = world cell minus the flight shift (state/direct.txt); the beam reaches obj_reach=2 cells from the hull rectangle; the hull may not sit on an object while the ship flies at or below obj_top=6.
GAME | rpg-space | rpg_space
EVENTS | yes
NEEDS | &.widgits/world-ops/ops/+x/wo.+x
# the rpg-space skin text-includes the shared petslike core and its helpers (the scratch house has only what is listed)
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/petslike_core.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/petslike_toolbar.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/pet_sky.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/pet_footer.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/pet_nudge.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/kh_state_notify.h
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/csv_frames.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/petslike_skin_lib.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/petslike_autotile.c
NEEDS | @.apps/rpg-space/ops/+x/dust_gen.+x
NEEDS | @.apps/rpg-space/ops/+x/dust_seed.+x
NEEDS | @.apps/rpg-space/ops/+x/dust_zoom.+x
NEEDS | @.apps/rpg-space/ops/+x/dust_orbit.+x
NEEDS | @.apps/rpg-space/ops/+x/dust_check.+x
# the planet pages are painted from RPG Maker sheets (the assets live above the house)
NEEDS | ../../../#.NNEST_ASSETS/rmmv-www-img/tilesets/Outside_A5.png | #.NNEST_ASSETS/rmmv-www-img/tilesets/Outside_A5.png
NEEDS | ../../../#.NNEST_ASSETS/rmmv-www-img/tilesets/Outside_B.png | #.NNEST_ASSETS/rmmv-www-img/tilesets/Outside_B.png
CFLAGS | -I$T/@.apps/rpg-space/ops
INIT | state/pet_ember.txt | room=bridge\nx=9\ny=5\ndir=1\nsteps=5\ntx=-1\nty=-1\n
INIT | state/life_ember.txt | hp=20\nhunger=3\ndead=0\ndeaths=0\ninv=bread:5,iron:11,scrap:32\n

INIT | state/look_ledger.txt | PLANET\p cata\n

PHASE | p1_seed | space.pdl WROCK and WCRAFT rows put three asteroids and the skiff on the planet map, once | planet map, seed, data
DO | space | status
FILEIS | state/pworld_planet.txt | cata\n | the-objects-belong-to-cata-prime
HAS | state/nodes.txt | region\p15\p5\pore\p5 | ore-asteroid-at-world-15-5
HAS | state/nodes.txt | region\p3\p14\prock\p7 | rock-asteroid-at-world-3-14
HAS | state/nodes.txt | region\p0\p9\pcrystal\p3 | crystal-asteroid-at-world-0-9
HAS | state/craft.txt | iron:2,bread:3\p14\p1 | the-skiff-has-a-world-cell-14-1
COUNT | state/space_seeded.txt | w_ | 4 | four-world-rows-seeded-once
DO | space | status
COUNT | state/space_seeded.txt | w_ | 4 | a-second-call-seeds-nothing-more

PHASE | p2_beam | in direct flight at the start the beam mines the NEAREST asteroid (the rock, 1 cell from the hull edge), then the next one (the ore, 2 cells) | mine, beam, direct, planet map
PUT | state/flag_helm.txt | 1\n
PUT | state/helm_mode.txt | direct\n
PUT | state/direct.txt | 0 0\n
DO | mine | here
SAY | rock broke at region 3,14 | the-nearest-asteroid-is-the-rock-and-one-beam-hit-breaks-it
HAS | state/nodes.txt | region\p3\p14\prock\p6 | the-rock-node-has-one-load-less
LACKS | state/nodes.txt | region\p3\p14\prock\p7 | the-old-rock-count-is-gone
HAS | state/drops.txt | region\p3\p14 | remnants-lie-on-the-planet-map-cell
DO | mine | here
SAY | rock broke at region 3,14 | the-rock-still-has-loads-so-it-is-still-the-nearest
HAS | state/nodes.txt | region\p3\p14\prock\p5 | the-rock-node-has-two-loads-less
PUT | state/direct.txt | 10 0\n
DO | mine | here
SAY | /5 | flown-east-the-ore-is-the-asteroid-beside-the-hull-and-takes-5-hits
HAS | state/damage.txt | region\p15\p5 | ore-damage-is-recorded-on-the-planet-map-cell
PUT | state/direct.txt | 0 0\n

PHASE | p3_hull | the hull may not be flown onto the ore asteroid or onto the skiff while it flies low, and may when it flies above them | collision, planet map, altitude
PUT | state/direct.txt | 1 0\n
DO | helm | move | 1 | 0
SAY | an asteroid is in the way at 15,5 | low-hull-refused-over-the-asteroid
FILEIS | state/direct.txt | 1 0\n | the-ship-did-not-move
PUT | state/direct.txt | 1 0\n
DO | helm | move | 0 | -1
SAY | Wren (skiff) is there | low-hull-refused-over-the-skiff
PUT | state/direct_z.txt | 8\n
DO | helm | move | 1 | 0
FILEIS | state/direct.txt | 2 0\n | high-hull-flies-over-the-asteroid
